<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Static helper class providing various utilities to merge two scenes. It is intended as internal utility and NOT for use by applications. </para>



<para>The class is currently being used by various postprocessing steps and loaders (ie. LWS). </para>
</section>
